## 🔧 **How we plan to do it (high-level technical)**

"On the technical side, we plan to connect the agent to different Waystar modules — like Remits, Denial Management, Claim Management, and User Management.

We’ll use data from these modules in real time, but with strict controls so only the right users see the right information.

We’ll also use Data Cloud to securely link client accounts and ensure permissions are respected, so there’s no risk of exposing sensitive data.

And of course, any actions taken by the agent will be logged for compliance and audit purposes."

