What makes it different from current automation
Today’s support mostly relies on static self-service content (knowledge articles) and manual case submissions, with human teams reviewing and responding later.

Current automation, if any, is limited to basic workflows or article suggestions — it doesn’t handle real-time data queries or complex AR guidance.

⚡ How Wayfinder Agent improves this
Moves from simple article lookups to live, personalized answers, pulling real-time data directly from claims, remittance, and user management systems.

Enables clients to take immediate action, such as paying a bill, checking claim status, or resetting access — rather than just reading static instructions.

Seamlessly escalates unresolved or complex issues, handing off with full context to the right internal teams.
